      "topology": 5,
      "completeness": 5,
      "style_fit": 5
    },
    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Twelve-arm bronze chandelier on two tiers with cut-crystal bobeches, candle sleeves and flame-tip bulbs, scrolled arms, a turned central body, a twisted fabric cable and a ceiling cup. Top and bottom views show the full radial arm layout and the underside boss. Crystal and bronze read as distinct materials from every angle.",
    "limitations": [
      "Candle bulbs do not emit light by default; add emitters.",
      "Not rigged: arms are fixed and the cable will not sway.",
      "High visual complexity for a real-time ceiling fixture; consider an LOD."
    ],
